<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44594" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐοδ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>help on the way</i>, c. dat. pers., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφῷν δ᾽ εὐοδοίη Ζεύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					1435
				</span></i>
			 (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφώ</span>): c. acc.
			pers., <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ge.</u>
				24.27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				4.299.14
			</span></i>: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ εὐοδοῦν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					5.6.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>have a prosperous journey</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Da.</u>
				8.11
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Rom.</u>
				1.10
			</span></i>; of things, <i>prosper, be successful</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς Κλεομένεϊ εὐωδώθη τὸ πρῆγμα</span>
			v. l. in <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.73
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θησαυρίζων ὅ τι ἂν εὐοδῶται,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπορῇ</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Cor.</u>
				16.2
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Act.Ap.</u>
				11.29
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
